From: macOS-Pad-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] NativeUfs: native_ufs_source_create for the source storage runtime, as UniXNU/ShengUfs 99d8bcd

SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause-Patent

The source storage recipe compiles NativeUfs with -DNATIVE_UFS_SOURCE_API=1, and SourceStorage.cpp (the board
package's, pipa's as sheng's) creates the UFS service through native_ufs_source_create(). PipaUfs 5c64c01
predates that entry point: the archive of kernel-build run 43106623934 left it undefined. This adds the
catalog pin's definition unchanged (a new NativeUfs, nothing else); outside the source API nothing changes.

--- a/NativeUfs.cpp
+++ b/NativeUfs.cpp
@@ -1685,6 +1685,15 @@
 };
 OSDefineMetaClassAndStructors (NativeUfsBlock, IOBlockStorageDevice)
 
+#if defined(NATIVE_UFS_SOURCE_API) && NATIVE_UFS_SOURCE_API
+// The source runtime owns registration and attachment after IOStorageFamily
+// has loaded. No second IOKit personality starts this service in that mode.
+extern "C" IOService *native_ufs_source_create (void)
+{
+  return new NativeUfs;
+}
+#endif
+
 extern "C" {
 volatile uint32_t native_ufs_blocks_published = 0;
 volatile uint64_t native_ufs_block_reads = 0;
